{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118459","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118459/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118459/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118459/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118459","id":4246519106,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HL1C","number":118459,"title":"LightStorage::set_max_lights() and set_max_reflection_probes() leak previous allocations on re-call","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:28:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:13Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/light_storage.cpp`, `set_max_lights()` (line 593) and `set_max_reflection_probes()` (line 1743) allocate new arrays and GPU buffers without freeing the previous ones:\n\n```cpp\nvoid LightStorage::set_max_lights(const uint32_t p_max_lights) {\n    max_lights = p_max_lights;\n    // No call to free_light_data() first!\n    omni_lights = memnew_arr(LightData, max_lights);          // overwrites pointer\n    omni_light_buffer = RD::get_singleton()->storage_buffer_create(...);  // leaks old RID\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\nCleanup functions `free_light_data()` and `free_reflection_data()` exist and properly free these resources, but are not called before re-allocation. If either function is called more than once (e.g., project setting changes at runtime), the previous CPU arrays and GPU buffers are leaked.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Change rendering settings that trigger `set_max_lights()` or `set_max_reflection_probes()` a second time.\n2. Memory leak of the previous allocations.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — resource leak visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.